{
  "id": "conservation_of_momentum",
  "title": "Conservation of Momentum",
  "description": "A comprehensive tool for calculating linear and angular momentum in physics. Includes calculators for collision momentum, recoil velocity, and angular momentum conservation.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Conservation of Momentum\n\n### Linear Momentum\n\nThe momentum of a body is defined as the product of its mass and velocity:\n\n**ML = m × v**\n\nWhere:\n- ML = linear momentum (kg·m/s)\n- m = mass of body (kg)\n- v = velocity of body (m/s)\n\n**Conservation Principle:** The total linear momentum of a system before collision equals the total momentum after collision:\n\n**m₁v₁ + m₂v₂ + ... + mₙvₙ = m₁u₁ + m₂u₂ + ... + mₙuₙ**\n\n### Angular Momentum\n\nFor a rotating body:\n\n**MR = ω × I**\n\nWhere:\n- MR = angular momentum (kg·m²/s)\n- ω = angular velocity (rad/s)\n- I = moment of inertia (kg·m²)\n\n**Conservation of Angular Momentum:** ω₁I₁ = ω₂I₂"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Linear Momentum Collision Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "mass1",
          "label": "Mass 1",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 30,
          "unit": "kg"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity1_before",
          "label": "Velocity 1 (Before Collision)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 30,
          "unit": "m/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "mass2",
          "label": "Mass 2",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "kg"
        },
        {
          "id": "velocity2_before",
          "label": "Velocity 2 (Before Collision)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 20,
          "unit": "m/s"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "momentum_before",
          "label": "Total Momentum Before Collision",
          "formula": "inputs.mass1 * inputs.velocity1_before + inputs.mass2 * inputs.velocity2_before",
          "unit": "kg·m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "combined_velocity",
          "label": "Combined Velocity (if stuck together)",
          "formula": "(inputs.mass1 * inputs.velocity1_before + inputs.mass2 * inputs.velocity2_before) / (inputs.mass1 + inputs.mass2)",
          "unit": "m/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Recoil Velocity Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "projectile_weight",
          "label": "Projectile Weight",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.035,
          "unit": "lb"
        },
        {
          "id": "projectile_velocity",
          "label": "Projectile Velocity (Muzzle Speed)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2100,
          "unit": "ft/s"
        },
        {
          "id": "gun_weight",
          "label": "Gun/Rifle Weight",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 6,
          "unit": "lb"
        },
        {
          "id": "slowdown_distance",
          "label": "Recoil Slow Down Distance",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.125,
          "unit": "ft"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "recoil_velocity",
          "label": "Recoil Velocity",
          "formula": "- (inputs.projectile_weight * inputs.projectile_velocity) / inputs.gun_weight",
          "unit": "ft/s",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "recoil_kinetic_energy",
          "label": "Recoil Kinetic Energy",
          "formula": "0.5 * inputs.gun_weight * ((inputs.projectile_weight * inputs.projectile_velocity) / inputs.gun_weight) * ((inputs.projectile_weight * inputs.projectile_velocity) / inputs.gun_weight)",
          "unit": "lb·ft",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "recoil_force",
          "label": "Recoil Force (to slow down)",
          "formula": "(0.5 * inputs.gun_weight * ((inputs.projectile_weight * inputs.projectile_velocity) / inputs.gun_weight) * ((inputs.projectile_weight * inputs.projectile_velocity) / inputs.gun_weight)) / inputs.slowdown_distance",
          "unit": "lb",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Angular Momentum Conservation Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "initial_rpm",
          "label": "Initial Rotation Velocity",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "rpm"
        },
        {
          "id": "initial_radius",
          "label": "Initial Radius",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1.5,
          "unit": "m"
        },
        {
          "id": "final_radius",
          "label": "Final Radius",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2.5,
          "unit": "m"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "final_rpm",
          "label": "Final Rotation Velocity",
          "formula": "inputs.initial_rpm * inputs.initial_radius / inputs.final_radius",
          "unit": "rpm",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}